<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed mostly higher on Friday in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index closed at 556.01, up 0.49.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 251 to 229.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $0.17.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 16,906,980, compared with 16,430,120 on Thursday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EST/2130 GMT)</p>
